Fix Enter and soft-key edits on mobile IMEs (Android virtual keyboards) in the editor.

Soft keyboards deliver Enter as a keyCode 229/isComposing keydown plus a
cancelable beforeinput (insertLineBreak/insertParagraph) that never mutates
the textarea, so the newline used to be silently dropped in both edit
contexts (textarea and native EditContext).

